/target
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/coverage
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# A sealing key a test or a local run created; never committed.
**/secrets.key
__pycache__/

# Local validation output and machine-specific browser launch adapters.
/settings-*.log
/soak-followups/target/
/web/playwright.*.local.ts
/node_modules/

# Cloud infrastructure (infra/, docs/decisions/2026-11-08-X-cloud-infra.md).
# Terraform state, plans and variable files are never committed anywhere.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
# Credentials, local state and logs are scoped to infra/ so tracked test
# fixtures (*.pem, *.key) and soak evidence (*.log) elsewhere stay visible.
infra/**/.aws/
infra/**/.venv/
infra/**/.pytest_cache/
infra/**/state/
infra/**/logs/
infra/**/secrets/**
infra/**/.env
infra/**/.env.*
!infra/**/.env.example
infra/**/*.pem
infra/**/*.key
infra/**/id_ed25519
infra/**/id_rsa
infra/**/*.p12
infra/**/*.pfx
infra/**/*.log
infra/**/*.zip
